-prahv","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-1","order":367,"story_date":"2012-08-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":39,"quote":"Learn to spell, Mr. Lapt, and stop wasting my precious time.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-1#:~:text=Learn%20to%20spell%2C%20Mr.,wasting%20my%20precious%20time.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Shadows of Prahv, Part 1","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-08-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-1","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-1#:~:text=Learn%20to%20spell%2C%20Mr.,wasting%20my%20precious%20time.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Shadows of Prahv, Part 1\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Aug 2012."}},{"id":"the-shadows-of-prahv-part-1-e8","era":null,"summary":"Relov signs an Orzhov enforcer's urgent application despite twelve statute violations when he sees the bribe amount.","participants":["relov","orzhov-syndicate"],"location":"new-prahv","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-1","order":367,"story_date":"2012-08-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":47,"quote":"The request violated twelve statutes, but when Relov saw the pale pink number printed at the bottom, he signed without hesitation.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-1#:~:text=The%20request%20violated%20twelve,he%20signed%20without%20hesitation.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Shadows of Prahv, Part 1","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-08-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-1","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-par